  "description": "Scento Path MD is designed to navigate the urban jungle. Cobblestone back alleys, potholes and anything else your commute may throw at you, MD will get you there, in comfort and on time. A Shimano Altus drivetrain fitted to a quality alloy frame is at the heart of this bike. Rack and fender compatibility is a must for bike like this. Hydraulic disc brakes are powerful, easy to use, offers great modulation, and is all-weather and terrain friendly. The MD is fitted with mechanical disc brakes, alloy components, flat bars and quality, fast rolling rubber. Take the shortest route and get there quicker!",
